<title>AUSTRALIA: Rates policy focussed 12-18 months ahead - Costello.</title>
<headline>Rates policy focussed 12-18 months ahead - Costello.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday that authorities were focussed 12 to 18 months ahead in considering monetary policy.</p>
</text>
